{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When he wakes up, he finds himself in an escape pod. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He has no memory, doesn't know where he is, and can't even remember his own name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642680/extras/store_P_seak1.gif?t=1748053807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He arrives at a shopping street but there is no one there. Only a robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642680/extras/robots.gif?t=1748053807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The robot speaks to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;You have temporarily lost your memory. If you want to regain your memory quickly, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you should go to the museum and look around at various things.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> With nowhere to go, he decides to head to the museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Obtain a secretary hidden somewhere and learn and strengthen command skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0 It can also be learned at a dojo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642680/extras/airslash_test5.gif?t=1748053807\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642680/extras/flying_disc1.gif?t=1748053807\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642680/extras/jump_upper_cut1.gif?t=1748053807\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642680/extras/strike3.gif?t=1748053807\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642680/extras/helm_smash0.gif?t=1748053807\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642680/extras/biggest_wave0.gif?t=1748053807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Enemies have attributes, and each has their own resistances and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons and command skills also have attributes, so you can change weapons depending on the enemy or use command skills to exploit their weak points when fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Filiy Friends are somewhere, so find them and make them your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filiy Friends' abilities will expand the places you can explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642680/extras/FF_3.gif?t=1748053807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cfExplore this star and find out why everyone has disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This is a demo version. There are no functional limitations, but there are some areas that cannot be reached.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It will end at the beginning of the story and you will not be able to proceed further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642680?t=1748053807","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642680/98196935f2d908f4513a947cd315164cee6ddbc5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748053807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.stea